## Attribution Examples

### When using the material:

**Recommended format:**
```
Kurikulum Teknik Informatika ITB
Source: https://github.com/ahmadsafii/kurikulum-itb
License: CC BY 4.0
Contributor(s): [list contributors if modified]
```

**In academic citations:**
```
@misc{kurikulum-itb,
  title={Kurikulum Teknik Informatika ITB - Materi Pembelajaran},
  author={Safii, Ahmad and contributors},
  year={2026},
  howpublished={\url{https://github.com/ahmadsafii/kurikulum-itb}},
  license={CC BY 4.0}
}
```

